===Format===
* '''Knockout Stage:''''' July 10th - 12th, 2024
** 18 teams, divided into 3 groups of 6.
** 18 matches, each group play 12.
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 12 teams}} advance to ''Points Rush'' and ''Grand Finals''.
<div style="margin-top:12px"></div>
* '''Points Rush:''''' July 13th, 2024
** 12 teams.
** 6 matches.
** Teams gain headstart points for Grand Finals based on their final placements.
<div style="margin-top:12px"></div>
* '''Grand Finals:''''' July 14th, 2024
** 12 teams.
** Teams begin with headstart points from Points Rush.
** 6 matches.
<br/>
{{Points12|showtb=true}}

