The '''Esports World Cup''' (or '''EWC''' in short) is a tournament series that was announced in late 2023, building off the previously established '''Gamers8''' series.

On November 24th, 2024, '''Free Fire''' was announced to continue being part of the game titles' line-up in the second edition of the '''EWC'''<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://www.instagram.com/p/DCw5Ug8vqxH/ |title=Let’s run it back. 🏃🏻 |date=2024-11-24|publisher='''Esports World Cup'''}}</ref>, as an official Mid-Season Championship.

