===Format===
* '''Knockout Stage:''''' July 16th - 18th, 2025
** 18 teams, divided into 3 groups of 6.
** 18 matches, each group play 12.
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 12 teams}} advance to ''Point Rush'' and ''Grand Finals''.
<div style="margin-top:12px"></div>
* '''Point Rush:''''' July 19th, 2025
** 12 teams.
** 6 matches.
** Teams gain headstart points for Grand Finals based on their final placements.
<div style="margin-top:12px"></div>
* '''Grand Finals:''''' July 20th, 2025
** 12 teams.
** Teams begin with headstart points from Point Rush.
** Champion Rush format is applied. {{ChampionRush|maxmatch=10|crp=80|margin-left=2em}}
<br/>
