The '''Esports World Cup''' (or '''EWC''' in short) is a tournament series that was announced in late 2023, building off the previously established '''Gamers8''' series.

On October 8th, 2025, '''Free Fire''' was announced to continue being part of the game titles' line-up for the third iteration of the '''EWC'''.<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://www.instagram.com/p/DPjXCYrgsQL/ |title=We’re coming back in 2026 with a squad of the most prestigious esports titles 🏆 |date=2025-10-08 |publisher='''Esports World Cup'''}}</ref>

On January 19th, 2026, this edition will be the first global tournament to feature 24 teams, instead of 18.<ref name="2026 roadmap">{{Cite web|url=https://ff.garena.com/en/article/1605/ |title=Garena Unveils Free Fire 2026 Roadmap |publisher='''Garena''' |date=2026-01-19}}</ref>

On May 20, it was announced that the tournament, along with the entire ''Esports World Cup 2026'', will be held in Paris, France, instead of the original venue of Riyadh, Saudi Arabia.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/2057121960623006162|title=Esports World Cup 2026 is coming to Paris|author=Esports World Cup Federation|date=2026-05-20}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://esportsworldcup.com/en/news/ewc26-to-be-hosted-in-paris-france|title=Esports World Cup 2026 to be hosted in Paris, France|author=Esports World Cup Federation|date=2026-05-20|language={{flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

==About==
===Format===
:''*For qualification information, '''[[Esports_World_Cup/2026/Qualification|click here]]'''
* '''Group Stage:''''' July 15th - 16th, 2026
** 24 teams, divided into 2 groups of 12.
** 12 matches each group.
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams from each group}} qualify to ''Finals''.
** {{Bgcolortext|stay|5th - 10th placed teams from each group}} advance to ''Survival Stage''.
** {{Bgcolortext|down|Bottom 2 teams of each group}} are eliminated.
{{VerticalMargin}}
* '''Survival Stage:''''' July 17th, 2026
** 12 teams.
** 10 matches.
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} qualify for ''Finals''.
** {{Bgcolortext|down|Remaining teams}} are eliminated.
{{VerticalMargin}}
* '''Finals:''''' July 18th, 2026
** 12 teams.
** Champion Rush format is applied. {{ChampionRush|maxmatch=inf|crp=90|margin-left=2em}}
